WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.266
Thirteen colonies broke from Britain

2
00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:03.831
over taxes and rights.

3
00:00:03.831 --> 00:00:05.518
They wrote the first modern

4
00:00:05.518 --> 00:00:07.275
written constitution.

5
00:00:07.635 --> 00:00:11.241
The Declaration of Independence came

6
00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:12.403
in 1776.

7
00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:16.245
The US Constitution was written

8
00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:17.798
in 1787.

9
00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:20.867
The colonists' slogan: no taxation

10
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:23.148
without representation.

11
00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:25.667
India borrowed ideas from it:

12
00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.419
a written constitution,

13
00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:28.522
judicial review,

14
00:00:28.522 --> 00:00:30.417
and a bill of rights.

15
00:00:30.751 --> 00:00:31.922
Your turn.

16
00:00:31.922 --> 00:00:34.125
When was it adopted?
